{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed","name":"Grapple","source":{"id":"source:reference-4c93c2c050c768ed","title":"Grapple","revision":18220,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:48:27Z","sha256":"583500ac20590290db2244accbc709eeb92b0b9661087e4df4a04bf8f68e3945","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18220","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Grapple&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4c93c2c050c768ed","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Saga Edition FAQ"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Saga_Edition_FAQ"}," (Q154))"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Grapple attack is an improved version of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"},". You can only make a Grapple attack (a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},") if you have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappling Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappling_Feat"}," (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pin","referenceId":"reference:ff1cee74414621d8"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trip"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trip","referenceId":"reference:bd13d5a0906be48e"},"). You can only Grapple an opponent up to one size category larger than you, and only one opponent at a time. A Grappling attack is treated as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," (thus provoking ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," without the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"}," feat), except that it deals no damage. If the Grappling attack hits, you and the target immediately make opposed Grapple checks. A Grapple check is:\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["1d20 + ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," + ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," modifier (whichever is higher) + Size Modifier (see below)"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If your check result equals or exceeds the target's check result, the target is Grappled.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The effects of a Grapple depend on the specific Feat or combination of Feats you are using (for example; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pin","referenceId":"reference:ff1cee74414621d8"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pin","referenceId":"reference:ff1cee74414621d8"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crush"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crush","referenceId":"reference:fd4982bc31020a05"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trip"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trip","referenceId":"reference:bd13d5a0906be48e"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trip"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trip","referenceId":"reference:bd13d5a0906be48e"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Throw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Throw","referenceId":"reference:c78054582e89a9a7"},"). Alternatively, if you are armed with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Weapon"},", you may deal damage with that weapon if you win the opposed Grapple check; no attack roll is necessary.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Size Modifiers"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Size modifiers for Grapple checks are as follows:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["GRAPPLE MODIFIER\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["\n"],"rowspan":7},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["GRAPPLE MODIFIER\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Fine\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Huge\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+10\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Diminutive\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gargantuan\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+15\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Tiny\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+20\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Small\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal (Frigate)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+25\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Medium\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal (Cruiser)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+30\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Large\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal (Station)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+35\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
